    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 9f0c42f85ad2dbd08bda36ed98bc82b9255aec05 -->\n**Review (M3, local PR-reviewer, delta over #1131, head-only, posted under PROCESS_VERSION 32): no code blockers, but the PR conflicts with main.**\n\n**Conflicts:** the same rebase as #1131. In `stamp.rs`, the `sinker-wear` digest must follow the digests that move into `stamp_tool`. `screenshot.png` and the README lines are already on main and drop out.\n\n**What holds:**\n- Each layer's tip is `(top-d)+gap-rate*d`, and every move is re-checked against the deepest tip.\n- The rate is validated in `[0,1)` at four doors.\n- A wear setting on a wire machine is refused by name.\n- The sim judges the worn tip. That is documented: a misstated rate can't be caught by the sim.\n\n**Tests at the head:**\n- motion 202, post 39, app lib 148.\n- app: `sinker_wear` 6, `sinker_burn` 8, `golden_cl` 25, `operations` 117, plus others.\n- Clippy: clean.\n\n**Not exercised:** the merged result, and a real cut.\n",
